ndard","type":"choice","prompt":"想说服务最差，哪一句合适？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"It has the most bad service."},{"key":"B","text":"It has the worse service of all."},{"key":"C","text":"It has the baddest service."},{"key":"D","text":"It has the worst service."}],"answer":"D","explanation":"bad 的最高级是 worst。","verify":"\"It has the worst service.\""},{"id":"cne_j116_q1","topicId":"cne_j116","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"Town Cinema has the biggest screen. It has the most comfortable seats. 最大的屏幕在哪里？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"学校"},{"key":"B","text":"Town Cinema"},{"key":"C","text":"家里"},{"key":"D","text":"短文没说"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"Town Cinema has the biggest screen。","verify":"\"Town Cinema\""},{"id":"cne_j116_q2","topicId":"cne_j116","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"Town Cinema has the biggest screen. It has the most comfortable seats. 座位怎么样？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"最少"},{"key":"B","text":"比别家更差"},{"key":"C","text":"最舒服"},{"key":"D","text":"短文没说"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"the most comfortable seats。","verify":"\"最舒服\""},{"id":"cne_j116_q3","topicId":"cne_j116","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"Movie World is the cheapest, but the service is the worst. 最便宜的是哪一家？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"Town Cinema"},{"key":"B","text":"两家一样"},{"key":"C","text":"短文没说"},{"key":"D","text":"Movie World"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"Movie World is the cheapest。","verify":"\"Movie World\""},{"id":"cne_j116_q4","topicId":"cne_j116","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"Movie World is the cheapest, but the service is the worst. 哪一句和短文一致？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"Movie World has the worst service."},{"key":"B","text":"Movie World has the best service."},{"key":"C","text":"Town Cinema is the cheapest."},{"key":"D","text":"The seats are the worst."}],"answer":"A","explanation":"便宜，但是服务最差。","verify":"\"Movie World has the worst service.\""}]
